function parseVerse(input){const m=String(input||'').trim().match(/^(.+?)\s*(\d{1,3})(?:\s*:\s*(\d{1,3})(?:\s*[-–~]\s*(\d{1,3}))?)?$/);if(!m)return null;const normalize=x=>x.replace(/\s+/g,'').toLowerCase();let book=bibleBooks.findIndex(b=>b.slice(0,3).some(x=>normalize(x)===normalize(m[1])));if(book<0)return null;const chapter=Number(m[2]),start=m[3]?Number(m[3]):0,end=m[4]?Number(m[4]):start;if(chapter<1||chapter>bibleBooks[book][3]||start>176||end>176||(m[3]&&start<1)||end<start)return null;return {book:book+1,chapter,start,end}}
function verseUrl(text){const v=parseVerse(text);if(!v)return 'https://www.jw.org/ko/%EA%B2%80%EC%83%89/?q='+encodeURIComponent(text);const code=(verse)=>String(v.book).padStart(2,'0')+String(v.chapter).padStart(3,'0')+String(verse).padStart(3,'0');return 'https://www.jw.org/finder?wtlocale=KO&pub=nwt&bible='+code(v.start)+(v.end!==v.start?'-'+code(v.end):'')}
function relatedReason(a,b){if(a.verse&&b.verse){const x=parseVerse(a.verse),y=parseVerse(b.verse);if(x&&y&&x.book===y.book&&x.chapter===y.chapter&&((x.start===0||y.start===0)||(x.start<=y.end&&y.start<=x.end)))return '같은 성구';if(!x&&!y&&a.verse.trim()===b.verse.trim())return '같은 성구'}const tags=x=>(x.topic||'').split(',').map(t=>t.trim().toLocaleLowerCase()).filter(Boolean);const other=tags(b);const match=tags(a).find(t=>other.includes(t));return match?'같은 주제 · '+match:''}
function relatedNotes(n){return notes.filter(other=>other.id!==n.id).map(other=>({note:other,reason:relatedReason(n,other)})).filter(x=>x.reason).slice(0,3)}
function noteCard(n){let ref=safeUrl(n.reference_url);return `<article class="note" id="note-${esc(n.id)}"><div class="note-meta"><span class="author ${n.author==='mine'?'mine':'bora'}">${n.author==='mine'?'민수':'보라'}</span><span>${esc(date(n.created_at))}${n.updated_at?' · 수정됨':''}</span>${virtualPerson(currentPerson)&&n.person!==currentPerson?`<span>· ${esc(virtualPerson(n.person)?.display||n.person)}</span>`:''}</div><h3>${esc(n.title)}</h3>${n.verse?`<a class="scripture" href="${esc(verseUrl(n.verse))}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="${esc(n.verse)} ${parseVerse(n.verse)?'공식 성경에서 보기':'JW.ORG에서 검색'}" title="${parseVerse(n.verse)?'공식 성경에서 열기':'JW.ORG에서 검색'}">${esc(n.verse)} ↗</a>`:''}<p>${esc(n.body)}</p>${n.topic?`<div class="tags">${n.topic.split(',').filter(Boolean).map(t=>`<a href="${idHash('@topic:'+t.trim())}"># ${esc(t.trim())}</a>`).join('')}</div>`:''}${ref?`<a class="ref-link" href="${esc(ref)}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">관련 자료 열기 ↗</a>`:''}<div class="note-images" data-images="${esc(n.id)}"></div>${relatedNotes(n).length?`<details class="related-notes"><summary>관련 기록 ${relatedNotes(n).length}</summary>${relatedNotes(n).map(({note:r,reason})=>`<a href="${idHash(r.person)}?note=${encodeURIComponent(r.id)}"><span>${esc(r.title)}</span><small>${esc(virtualPerson(r.person)?.display||r.person)} · ${r.author==='mine'?'민수':'보라'} · ${esc(reason)}</small></a>`).join('')}</details>`:''}<div class="note-actions"><button class="link" data-copy-note="${esc(n.id)}">링크 복사</button><button class="link" data-edit="${esc(n.id)}">수정</button><button class="link" data-delete="${esc(n.id)}">삭제</button></div></article>`}
function heading(k,title,desc){return `<div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">${k}</div><h1>${title}</h1><p>${desc}</p></div></div>`}
